-millions-of-customers-accounts-and-sparked-protests/a-79868484?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Paraguay's President Santiago Pena has resigned amid a crisis over his ties to collapsed lender Ueno. Millions of customers' accounts are frozen, with public pension and health care funds also tied up.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>British comedian and actor Russell Brand found guilty of rape</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a01e0131cc671cb1488f2857dce48a4a479b86d13488edf035e2fa9a1538ba7f</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:35:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T15:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/british-comedian-and-actor-russell-brand-found-guilty-of-rape/a-79867216--4d18f4874d57.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/british-comedian-and-actor-russell-brand-found-guilty-of-rape/a-79867216?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Prosecutors labeled Brand a sexual predator, he was charged in sexual assault cases spanning from 1999 to 2009.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Iran signals satisfaction, skepticism after US midterm vote</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8ca23c0d3b2589169b5b7d1ef87e04987ed1daf0da3c019853636b2e65d1a7f2</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:35:19Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T15:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-signals-satisfaction-skepticism-after-us-midterm-vote/a-79867149--f14e22022dc8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-signals-satisfaction-skepticism-after-us-midterm-vote/a-79867149?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">While the Iranian regime says the US midterms will not change Washington's policy toward Tehran, some officials and commentators see the resounding Democratic victory as blowback against the Iran war.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Who is drug testing Russia's athletes, now that they have returned to international competition?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f45288be514bf3f49d91818f105854900acfdfa29dd3db7e35c64812f915962c</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:35:25Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T14:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/who-is-drug-testing-russia-s-athletes-now-that-they-have-returned-to-international-competition/a-79862467--23bc7b6e6570.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/who-is-drug-testing-russia-s-athletes-now-that-they-have-returned-to-international-competition/a-79862467?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">DW has found that three-quarters of Russia's weightlifting team had no independent out-of-competition testing before this year's world championships, despite the country's doping history.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>EU court says CBD foods need approval for sale before they can be certified organic</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5ec94bf398a9fa2d8c9b6c9d0c58d4efdd47784c9b25c521cf8f3f03c0257c47</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:35:22Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T14:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-court-says-cbd-foods-need-approval-for-sale-before-they-can-be-certified-organic/a-79865773--d6216a4c45a5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-court-says-cbd-foods-need-approval-for-sale-before-they-can-be-certified-organic/a-79865773?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The EU's top court says CBD foods cannot be certified organic without approval for sale. The ruling concerns a cannabis compound whose use in food requires authorization, including before organic certification.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>What does Trump's midterm elections loss mean for strained US-India ties?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:900cc4b6e8dd2a2555b05881c54b78220ee1093594899f721759ad4db6d77af0</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:35:28Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T13:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-does-trump-s-midterm-elections-loss-mean-for-strained-us-india-ties/a-79865777--7836c1679b1c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-does-trump-s-midterm-elections-loss-mean-for-strained-us-india-ties/a-79865777?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump's electoral setback might give New Delhi and Washington space to reset relations, but there is no guarantee that the US will actually change its approach to India.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Pioneering Jewish academy opens in Germany</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:eefc3d2d1d1ebd9eec59141dd66a1373caf2e0ffcb00de0ddceab4a901ea9ea0</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:35:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T11:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pioneering-jewish-academy-opens-in-germany/a-79863293--10bb65c14f4e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pioneering-jewish-academy-opens-in-germany/a-79863293?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Jewish academy has opened its doors in Frankfurt. The Central Council of Jews in Germany, the country’s leading Jewish umbrella group, set up the project to combat hate and promote dialogue and learning nationally.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Cristiano Ronaldo announces retirement from international football</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a90961f3bfec76aa68ba7f890f472e8556e9f32e07c960bbd5828a92509655b4</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:35:34Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T11:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/cristiano-ronaldo-announces-retirement-from-international-football/a-79864361--825ad0ac29c2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/cristiano-ronaldo-announces-retirement-from-international-football/a-79864361?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The announcement by the footballing legend comes just weeks after a public spat with Portugal coach Jorge Jesus over playing time.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>North Korea tells EU to 'mind its own business' on human rights</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ffe1b035c6c43a3e06d05e2da33033c232e2a4f4e6011e18a2b6c02f623c97e5</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:35:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T11:14:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-korea-tells-eu-to-mind-its-own-business-on-human-rights/a-79862196--b096a2c3122f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/north-korea-tells-eu-to-mind-its-own-business-on-human-rights/a-79862196?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">North Korea's UN mission has lashed out at the European Union over a draft UN resolution. Pyongyang has said the West does not have a monopoly on human rights.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Poland arrests 4 over alleged spying for Russia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b832ce0b0eb2f2b3241c668ad7e02d8d4b7796ecc4ec3fe8e7e9b22c300dbfe1</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:35:40Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T10:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/poland-arrests-4-over-alleged-spying-for-russia/a-79862829--e5859ed2238a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/poland-arrests-4-over-alleged-spying-for-russia/a-79862829?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Poland has charged four people with espionage, saying they were sending information to Moscow. Two more have been accused of shipping military components to Russia.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Finland court jails captain and crew member over Baltic cable sabotage</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bfa55fb50294e282a4a53955b37bca6bce597006150f1ef0bbf99f0026fd10a7</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:35:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T10:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/finland-court-jails-captain-and-crew-member-over-baltic-cable-sabotage/a-79862519--53a7b215b3b5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/finland-court-jails-captain-and-crew-member-over-baltic-cable-sabotage/a-79862519?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Finland seized the Fitburg freighter last year over the suspected sabotage of cables linking Helsinki and Tallinn. It's one of several incidents of damaged infrastructure in the Baltic since Russia's invasion of Ukraine.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Several European flights receive bomb threats, some divert</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6ef98af3f54717329358cab904258bbe02cc6bd87c063b1072c416dc25beeafa</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:35:46Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T10:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/several-european-flights-receive-bomb-threats-some-divert/a-79861216--778bd07a8276.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/several-european-flights-receive-bomb-threats-some-divert/a-79861216?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">At least a dozen flights were either diverted or landed with a military escort after bomb or security threats. The first reported case involved a flight from Dublin to Rome landing outside Paris and more soon followed.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>South Korea tests Arctic shipping route amid Russia-West row</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:56056dccb9e7f473b52a8d2eb40c12be65c7623f0f23c36c919db3308a0ef9fe</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:35:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T09:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/south-korea-tests-arctic-shipping-route-amid-russia-west-row/a-79853907--d831b46c670a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/south-korea-tests-arctic-shipping-route-amid-russia-west-row/a-79853907?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">For South Korean ships, navigating off the north coast of Russia dramatically reduces travel time to Europe, but the pro-Ukraine coalition might see it as undermining their efforts to isolate Moscow.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Deportations on the decline</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:25714d799e3e4d2df9112cad29369a4af1292ad7bf9ef9137dd326d5360f8f6e</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:34:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T09:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-deportations-on-the-decline/live-79860126--231ad2fcde65.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-deportations-on-the-decline/live-79860126?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Despite a decrease in overall deportations, more people were sent back to Turkey. Meanwhile, Volkswagen is facing a fresh 'Dieselgate' trial. And Germany's leading DAX stock index hit a new high. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>France braces for fresh protests as unions strike over higher wages</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:849ea2991d646abede60eaf02a784d726cc1ab2360ffe64a3d237899109c26b5</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:35:52Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T09:19:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/france-braces-for-fresh-protests-as-unions-strike-over-higher-wages/a-79860616--ad59476081b4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/france-braces-for-fresh-protests-as-unions-strike-over-higher-wages/a-79860616?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Unions representing the education sector, rail employees, public hospitals and postal services called the strike. Authorities have deployed some 70,000 police and security officers across the country.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India news: ​​Several feared trapped as building collapses in Old Delhi's Chawri Bazar</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a4be5bfa2b9a2e2d74e0f3e3ce3c36355dbfdc14744b742d05d5fe827b54c05a</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:35:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T07:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-_several-feared-trapped-as-building-collapses-in-old-delhi-s-chawri-bazar/live-79860330--a1bf871f58da.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-​​several-feared-trapped-as-building-collapses-in-old-delhi-s-chawri-bazar/live-79860330?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Rescue operations are ongoing as a building collapsed in Chawri Bazaar. Meanwhile, "Ramayana," starring Ranbir Kapoor and Sai Pallavi, has hit theaters. Follow DW for more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>What the Democrats' midterms win means for the US economy and Trump</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1ad511d9f5729eecd60729bb162daba672fd467ae25acec617ee982529b53c5b</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:34:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T07:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-the-democrats-midterms-win-means-for-the-us-economy-and-trump/a-79853716--124f824b0e07.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-the-democrats-midterms-win-means-for-the-us-economy-and-trump/a-79853716?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">From high oil prices and data centers to tariffs and mounting debt, economic concerns played a key role in the crushing defeat of President Donald Trump's Republicans. So can the Democrats now make a difference?</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Hong Kong democracy activist Joshua Wong sentenced to 10 more years</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:08e2a08ecb27e2e9e44f3269bb8b67189fc3f5722053427b3697eb39539f0a9e</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:34:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T05:32:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/hong-kong-democracy-activist-joshua-wong-sentenced-to-10-more-years/a-79859898--15d97090ad43.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/hong-kong-democracy-activist-joshua-wong-sentenced-to-10-more-years/a-79859898?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Joshua Wong, once a teen activist and one of the faces of the "Umbrella Movement," is spending years of his adult life in prison.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>NASA's Swift space telescope plunges back to Earth in fiery demise</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:57b69c01e9d53382b63aa80d7056ec492cd30d02ed52ea653ed9b38d7d770d2a</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:34:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T04:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nasa-s-swift-space-telescope-plunges-back-to-earth-in-fiery-demise/a-79859805--86b86ba56b3e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nasa-s-swift-space-telescope-plunges-back-to-earth-in-fiery-demise/a-79859805?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">NASA's Swift orbital observatory fell back to Earth after running its mission for more than two decades. A rescue attempt to raise its sinking orbit had earlier failed.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Democrats take House and Senate from Republicans in US midterm rout</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7be0bdde02fc29f7286b308cce58fb1378becae6290fd46fa0328b9e2754cd16</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:34:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T23:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/democrats-take-house-and-senate-from-republicans-in-us-midterm-rout/a-79859416--db0c6e2ab972.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/democrats-take-house-and-senate-from-republicans-in-us-midterm-rout/a-79859416?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Democrats will control both chambers of Congress after flipping seats in Republican strongholds across the US in an election seen as a repudiation of President Donald Trump.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
